with options(name,alternatives) as (values ('Flat Machine Press or Flat Dumbbell Press','Flat dumbbell bench press|Machine chest press'),('Dumbbell bench press','Flat dumbbell bench press|Machine chest press'),('Flat dumbbell bench press','Flat dumbbell bench press|Machine chest press'),('Seated Machine Chest Press','Flat dumbbell bench press|Machine chest press'),('Chest Supported Row','Chest Supported Dumbbell Row|Machine chest-supported row'),('Chest Supported Dumbbell Row','Chest Supported Dumbbell Row|Machine chest-supported row'),('Chest-Supported Dumbbell Row','Chest Supported Dumbbell Row|Machine chest-supported row'),('Seated DB Shoulder Press','Seated dumbbell shoulder press|Shoulder Press Machine'),('Seated Dumbbell Shoulder Press','Seated dumbbell shoulder press|Shoulder Press Machine'),('Dumbbell Shoulder Press','Seated dumbbell shoulder press|Shoulder Press Machine'),('Shoulder Press Machine','Seated dumbbell shoulder press|Shoulder Press Machine'),('Seated Machine Shoulder Press','Seated dumbbell shoulder press|Shoulder Press Machine'),('Seated DB Bicep Curl','Seated Dumbbell Bicep Curl|Dumbbell Bicep Curl'),('Seated Dumbbell Bicep Curl','Seated Dumbbell Bicep Curl|Dumbbell Bicep Curl'),('Dumbbell Bicep Curl','Seated Dumbbell Bicep Curl|Dumbbell Bicep Curl'),('Pull-Ups or Assisted Pull-Ups','Normal-grip pull-up|Band-Assisted Pull-Up'),('DB Flat press','Flat dumbbell bench press|Machine chest press'),('Chest-Supported T-Bar Row','Seated cable row|Chest Supported Dumbbell Row'),('Cable Row','Seated cable row|Chest Supported Dumbbell Row'),('Seated Cable Row','Seated cable row|Chest Supported Dumbbell Row'),('Dumbbell Lateral Raise','Dumbbell lateral raise|Cable lateral raise'),('Cable Lateral Raise','Dumbbell lateral raise|Cable lateral raise'),('Seated DB Lateral Raise','Dumbbell lateral raise|Cable lateral raise'),('Cable Triceps Pressdown','Cable triceps pushdown|Dumbbell Overhead Triceps Extension'),('Tricep Cable Pushdown','Cable triceps pushdown|Dumbbell Overhead Triceps Extension'),('Tricep Cable Pushdowns','Cable triceps pushdown|Dumbbell Overhead Triceps Extension'),('Tricep Rope Pushdown','Cable triceps pushdown|Dumbbell Overhead Triceps Extension'),('Cable triceps pushdown','Cable triceps pushdown|Dumbbell Overhead Triceps Extension'),('Dumbbell Hammer Curl','Dumbbell hammer curl|Cable Hammer Curl'),('Cable Hammer Curl','Dumbbell hammer curl|Cable Hammer Curl'),('Seated Hamstring Curl','Seated leg curl|Lying leg curl'),('Seated Leg Curl','Seated leg curl|Lying leg curl'),('Lying Leg Curl','Seated leg curl|Lying leg curl'),('Incline Dumbbell Press','Incline dumbbell press|Smith machine incline press'),('Incline Dumbbell Bench Press','Incline dumbbell press|Smith machine incline press'),('Smith Machine Incline Press','Incline dumbbell press|Smith machine incline press'),('Standing Calf Raises','Standing Dumbbell Calf Raise|Calf raise machine'),('Standing Dumbbell Calf Raise','Standing Dumbbell Calf Raise|Calf raise machine'),('Calf Raises','Standing Dumbbell Calf Raise|Calf raise machine'),('Preacher Curl Machine','Preacher curl machine|Seated Dumbbell Bicep Curl')) update public.program_exercises e set alternatives=o.alternatives from options o,public.training_program_days d,public.training_programs p,public.clients c where lower(trim(e.name))=lower(o.name) and e.program_day_id=d.id and d.program_id=p.id and p.client_id=c.id and c.status in ('active','ending') and nullif(trim(e.alternatives),'') is null returning e.name;